title: "Vertex-transitive Hadamard tournaments: Ito counterexamples need large fourth powers"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/vertex-transitive-hadamard-tournaments"
url: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/vertex-transitive-hadamard-tournaments"
license: GPL-3.0-only
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24448853
date-released: 2026-11-22
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24448853
